```

The exported hooks cover the full CRUD surface: `useMemos` and `useInfiniteMemos` (list), `useMemo` (get), `useCreateMemo`, `useUpdateMemo`, `useDeleteMemo`, plus `useMemoComments`, `useInfiniteMemoComments`, and `useLinkMetadata`. A `memoKeys` factory at line 12 centralizes cache keys so mutations can invalidate or patch list and detail entries consistently.

`memoServiceClient` itself is created from the `MemoService` proto definition and the shared Connect transport in `repo/web/src/connect.ts:197`.
